-# "Beans Generated SVG" maps (Figma exports) set font-family="Inter" on every
-# <text> with no fallback and no font loaded, so labels fell back to serif.
-# Matching on the attribute keeps the CMS "SVG labels font" working: svgHandler's
-# updateSvgTextFontFamily rewrites the attribute, so the rule stops matching.
- if community&.is_beans_svg?
  %link{:href => "https://fonts.googleapis.com", :rel => "preconnect"}/
  %link{:crossorigin => "", :href => "https://fonts.gstatic.com", :rel => "preconnect"}/
  %link{:href => "https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap", :rel => "stylesheet"}/
  :css
    svg text[font-family="Inter" i],
    svg tspan[font-family="Inter" i] {
      font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    }
